---
const columns=['decision being made','task description','required output','acceptance criteria','case','expected result','failure severity','model/configuration','prompt','tools allowed','retries allowed','result','score','reviewer notes'];
---
<section id="evaluate" class="guide-section" aria-labelledby="evaluate-title"><p class="step">09 · Verify on your work</p><h2 id="evaluate-title">Turn the shortlist into a small evaluation.</h2><ol class="evaluation-steps"><li>Define the decision and constraints.</li><li>Select representative real examples, including costly edge cases.</li><li>Remove confidential information.</li><li>Define objective scoring before running models.</li><li>Hold prompts, data, tools, and retry policy constant.</li><li>Record model, configuration, administration date, tools, and retries.</li><li>Preserve invalid, refused, timed-out, and unparsable outputs.</li><li>Review error types and severity—not only the average.</li><li>Keep a holdout set while tuning prompts.</li><li>Keep cases and scoring cheap enough to rerun.</li></ol><div class="worksheet"><h3>Blank evaluation worksheet</h3><p>The CSV is created in your browser. Nothing is uploaded or stored by Ultimate Bench.</p><button type="button" id="download-worksheet">Download blank CSV worksheet</button><button type="button" id="print-worksheet">Print this mini-guide</button><p id="worksheet-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="table-scroll"><table><caption>Fields included in the downloadable worksheet</caption><tbody>{columns.map(column=><tr><th scope="row">{column}</th><td>Complete before or after testing as appropriate.</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></div></section>
<script is:inline define:vars={{columns}}>
 const status=document.querySelector('#worksheet-status');
 document.querySelector('#download-worksheet')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const csv=`${columns.map(value=>`"${value.replaceAll('"','""')}"`).join(',')}\n${columns.map(()=> '""').join(',')}\n`;const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([csv],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}));const link=document.createElement('a');link.href=url;link.download='ultimate-bench-private-evaluation.csv';link.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(url);if(status)status.textContent='Blank CSV worksheet downloaded.';});
 document.querySelector('#print-worksheet')?.addEventListener('click',()=>window.print());
</script>
